us issues for some help on how to solve this, but didn't found how to","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/25931536/97623709-5f9aec00-1a26-11eb-8b38-63ee3f1b4839.PNG","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"interop","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"15","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL|microsoft/WSL\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1604000659}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V2GLp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cb1f34f-364e-4ad2-9b11-478566e8095b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"難易度…","ts":"1636358811.153000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mNk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90faa649-11c1-49f1-b226-69a20f729884","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(ちなみに MS アカウントに戻した)","ts":"1636356471.152800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c3AC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d3e8d3-456e-4a85-ba15-cad08940f069","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一旦ローカルアカウントに切り替えた際にパスワードを設定したのでアカウントにパスワードは設定されていそうなんだけどな…","ts":"1636356460.152400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kDi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d06d6a0d-81da-44b1-85ec-a1cfaa9d2960","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自動起動しないだけで一応動いているし","ts":"1636356408.151800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAQj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb58be9c-79ac-4c55-a629-7f177f17e453","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれこれ弄っていたら一旦 whoami は回避できるようになったけど今度はパスワードのプロンプトが出なくなってしまった…もう諦めようかな… :innocent:","ts":"1636356398.151500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","bloc