36351181.131200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61m4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ed8673f-949c-4d67-873e-95a3214aee23","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"一個前にthincaさんが引っかかっていた問題がkoronさんの手元では再現しないって話ですかね","ts":"1636351160.130600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ALZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7db4b307-092d-4c91-8465-2fa83a2f5c45","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Windowsの、だよね? 通常は管理者パスワード設定することはないかもしれない。","ts":"1636351159.130500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QGD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c06324e-235f-4c47-87f9-7262cc4d3b29","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"サインインオプションにパスワードというものがない","ts":"1636351144.130100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NJEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"021a926f-23fe-4776-a34a-888fb9061e00","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"whoami.exe の問題は解決していて、distrod が自身を Windows 起動時に一緒に起動するようにタスクスケジューラに登録しようとしていて、そのために管理者のパスワードを聞かれているけどそれが何かわからん、と言うところで今止まっています","ts":"1636351112.129400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2EL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95345138-d3d3-4ccb-a7ce-ef5c6731d5ea","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"だとすると手元で `sudo /mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32/whoami.exe` は動くなぁ","ts":"1636351088.128800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636351096.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AUEnE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06f1a55e-a345-43b3-87b0-bef3bc39cf0f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"WSLの設定でWindowsのPATHを継承するかどうかっていうのがあった気がします","ts":"1636351047.127800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hf=9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8770affd-ff8d-4e3d-8348-bc54cf73bca3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そこはフルパスで起動されているようなので大丈夫そうです","ts":"1636351046.127700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EQX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34d57a94-cef7-42c7-b447-88507218e260","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくのてもとではね","ts":"1636351026.127100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e9syz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9195e5bf-6ece-4ab1-8c2d-aae515bb7309","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なんかsudo whoami.exeするとpathが通ってないみたい。","ts":"1636351022.126900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cw7Cb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9905cf6-7ddc-41dc-8479-892b328e6f57","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうです","ts":"1636350968.126600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Td+8O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b99f4c9-0080-4a31-ae18-99ebc4ef2cfb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ん? sudo ってWSL内のsudoだよね。対してwhoami.exeはWindows側の。","ts":"1636350944.126400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vcuN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5681ff88-d890-4ae6-b7f0-6d8e7f084f6a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"管理者のパスワード、設定した覚えがない…連携している MS アカウントのパスワードではないようだし…","ts":"1636350842.125600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I4d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d75eccb8-b3ff-4fd2-bf2e-834032791218","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`sudo su -` で root になってから `whoami.exe` だと失敗しないことが判明。先に進めそう。今度は管理者のパスワードを何にしていたか忘れてしまったので思い出そうとしている…w","ts":"1636349886.125000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Yyt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1585545-65f9-4da1-822a-50e91ed2b28f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`whoami.exe` の実行結果がエラーになってしまっているっぽい。確かに `sudo whoami.exe` はエラーになる。しかし sudo なしだと distrod 自体が root が必要だと言ってくる","ts":"1636349690.124000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+8N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cbdebd7-fdda-40e0-a842-245c868e13ad","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Rust 製なのはよいなぁ","ts":"1636348539.122600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2V2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83320a96-3147-4643-a120-8ce55c52508d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Bash スクリプトくらいなら直せるけど更に深い部分はわからんな…まだ見てすらないけど…","ts":"1636348513.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nuk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f113054-7932-4fde-9f93-95bd66794596","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"無限コントリビュート編\n:goodpoem:","ts":"1636348355.121900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r3a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd1fc3d9-85f7-4bb4-ad64-3610c618d1be","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":":contribute-chance:","ts":"1636348342.121600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tar1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9ffddfe-0066-4249-b6c3-637cfb87f07d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今度は `/opt/distrod/bin/distrod enable --start-on-windows-boot` でエラー。UAC ダイアログが出るぞ、と言われたが、出ず、エラーになってしまった…むずい","ts":"1636348270.121400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P67=w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f18e4f0f-477c-4b5b-a0d0-cce06c68e524","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"pull/1 おめでとうございます","ts":"1636348157.120400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"